  "instruction": "Utility function to find the k-th node starting from the given node",
  "output": "    private ListNode getKthNode(ListNode curr, int k) {\n        while (curr != null && k > 0) {\n            curr = curr.next;\n            k--;\n        }\n        return curr;\n    }",
